# p2-fx-lab.drv - C1 combat FX lab: a fight at the start station, held in view.
#
# Verifies: C1 every HD combat effect on screen in one fight: laser beams,
#         muzzle blooms, hit flares, fireballs, smoke and debris.
# Run:  record once with --pace in --args and --timeout 400 (docs/hd/weapons.md,
#       Combat FX lab), then replay the tape to capture frames; the tape
#       lives outside git.  Unpaced, the waits run ahead and the fight is missed.
# Expect: launch, turn about to face the station, close in to about 1.5 km
#         and stop; then pulses of the front laser on the station (hit
#         flares) bring out its ships, and ships blow up 0.5-1.5 km ahead
#         while the view stays forward on the fight.
# Start 3 (docked), new game only, no purchase. The front view stays on.
wait 6000
key space
wait 2000
key 3
wait 11000
mouse 57 193
wait 300
click 200
wait 1500
mouse 130 19
wait 300
click 200
wait 31000
mouse 160 100
keydown rshift
wait 3000
